sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser HosakaAudio
  participant WS as ws_tts proxy
  participant U as upstream (piper or home)

  B->>WS: WS upgrade with cookie
  WS->>WS: session or guest_session, else close 1008
  B->>WS: JSON utterance
  WS->>WS: pick_upstream by backend
  Note over WS: busy upstream: cut stale conn, reconnect
  WS->>U: connect ws /v1/audio/stream, forward text
  U-->>WS: start
  WS-->>B: start
  loop PCM
    U-->>WS: float32 24kHz bytes
    WS-->>B: bytes, scheduled as AudioBufferSource
  end
  alt normal
    U-->>WS: end
    WS-->>B: end
  else upstream dies mid-utterance
    WS-->>B: error "tts upstream closed mid-utterance"
  else send or connect fails
    WS-->>B: error "tts upstream unreachable"
  end
